{"seq":2,"slug":"clean-architecture-flutter","title":"Clean Architecture 在 Flutter 中的实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/clean-architecture-flutter","wordCount":661,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"clean-architecture-在-flutter-中的实践\">Clean Architecture 在 Flutter 中的实践</h1><p>Clean Architecture（整洁架构）由 Robert C. Martin（Uncle Bob）提出，核心思想是通过<strong>依赖规则</strong>（Dependency Rule）实现关注点分离：内层业务逻辑不依赖外层实现细节。在 Flutter 项目中落地 Clean Architecture，可以显著提升代码可测试性、可维护性和可替换性。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>依赖规则</strong></td>\n<td>依赖方向只能由外层指向内层，内层不知道外层的存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Entity（实体）</strong></td>\n<td>领域模型，纯 Dart 类，不依赖任何框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Use Case（用例）</strong></td>\n<td>封装单一业务操作，只依赖 Entity 和 Repository 接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Repository（接口）</strong></td>\n<td>数据访问的抽象契约，定义在领域层，实现在数据层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Data Source</strong></td>\n<td>具体的数据来源（HTTP API、本地数据库、SharedPreferences）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Dependency Injection</strong></td>\n<td>在运行时注入具体实现，使内层代码依赖抽象而非具体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>get_it</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 生态最流行的服务定位器，实现依赖注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>injectable</strong></td>\n<td>get_it 的代码生成扩展，通过注解自动注册依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三层架构全景\">三层架构全景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;  subgraph Presentation[&quot;展示层&quot;]&#10;    W[Widget]&#10;    VM[ViewModel/Notifier]&#10;    W --&gt; VM&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph Domain[&quot;领域层 - 核心&quot;]&#10;    UC[Use Case]&#10;    E[Entity]&#10;    RI[Repository 接口]&#10;    UC --&gt; E&#10;    UC --&gt; RI&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph Data[&quot;数据层&quot;]&#10;    RImpl[Repository 实现]&#10;    RemoteDS[Remote Data Source]&#10;    LocalDS[Local Data Source]&#10;    DTO[DTO 模型]&#10;    RImpl --&gt; RemoteDS&#10;    RImpl --&gt; LocalDS&#10;    RemoteDS --&gt; DTO&#10;    LocalDS --&gt; DTO&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  VM --&gt; UC&#10;  RImpl --&gt; RI&#10;  DTO -.-&gt;|toEntity| E\">graph TB\n  subgraph Presentation[\"展示层\"]\n    W[Widget]\n    VM[ViewModel/Notifier]\n    W --&gt; VM\n  end\n\n  subgraph Domain[\"领域层 - 核心\"]\n    UC[Use Case]\n    E[Entity]\n    RI[Repository 接口]\n    UC --&gt; E\n    UC --&gt; RI\n  end\n\n  subgraph Data[\"数据层\"]\n    RImpl[Repository 实现]\n    RemoteDS[Remote Data Source]\n    LocalDS[Local Data Source]\n    DTO[DTO 模型]\n    RImpl --&gt; RemoteDS\n    RImpl --&gt; LocalDS\n    RemoteDS --&gt; DTO\n    LocalDS --&gt; DTO\n  end\n\n  VM --&gt; UC\n  RImpl --&gt; RI\n  DTO -.-&gt;|toEntity| E</pre><p><strong>关键约束</strong>：Domain 层（中间层）不导入 Flutter 框架，不导入 dio、isar 等任何第三方库——它只是纯 Dart 代码。这使得领域层可以独立测试，也可以被桌面端或 Web 端复用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"目录结构设计\">目录结构设计</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"lib/&#10;├── core/&#10;│   ├── error/           # 统一错误类型&#10;│   ├── network/         # HTTP 客户端配置&#10;│   └── di/              # 依赖注入注册&#10;│&#10;├── features/&#10;│   └── user/            # 按功能模块组织&#10;│       ├── data/&#10;│       │   ├── datasources/&#10;│       │   │   ├── user_remote_data_source.dart&#10;│       │   │   └── user_local_data_source.dart&#10;│       │   ├── models/&#10;│       │   │   └── user_dto.dart        # 含 toEntity() / fromJson()&#10;│       │   └── repositories/&#10;│       │       └── user_repository_impl.dart&#10;│       │&#10;│       ├── domain/&#10;│       │   ├── entities/&#10;│       │   │   └── user.dart            # 纯 Dart Entity&#10;│       │   ├── repositories/&#10;│       │   │   └── user_repository.dart # 抽象接口&#10;│       │   └── usecases/&#10;│       │       ├── get_current_user.dart&#10;│       │       └── update_user_profile.dart&#10;│       │&#10;│       └── presentation/&#10;│           ├── providers/&#10;│           │   └── user_providers.dart&#10;│           ├── pages/&#10;│           │   └── profile_page.dart&#10;│           └── widgets/&#10;│               └── user_avatar.dart\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>lib/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── core/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── error/           # 统一错误类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── network/         # HTTP 客户端配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── di/              # 依赖注入注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── features/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── user/            # 按功能模块组织</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── data/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   ├── datasources/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   │   ├── user_remote_data_source.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   │   └── user_local_data_source.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   ├── models/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   │   └── user_dto.dart        # 含 toEntity() / fromJson()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   └── repositories/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │       └── user_repository_impl.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── domain/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   ├── entities/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   │   └── user.dart            # 纯 Dart Entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   ├── repositories/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   │   └── user_repository.dart # 抽象接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │   └── usecases/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │       ├── get_current_user.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │       └── update_user_profile.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── presentation/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           ├── providers/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           │   └── user_providers.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           ├── pages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           │   └── profile_page.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           └── widgets/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│               └── user_avatar.dart</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"entity-领域模型\">Entity：领域模型</h2><p>Entity 是领域层的核心，代表业务中的真实概念。它是<strong>纯 Dart 类</strong>，不包含任何序列化逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// domain/entities/user.dart&#10;class User {&#10;  final String id;&#10;  final String name;&#10;  final String email;&#10;  final UserRole role;&#10;  final DateTime createdAt;&#10;&#10;  const User({&#10;    required this.id,&#10;    required this.name,&#10;    required this.email,&#10;    required this.role,&#10;    required this.createdAt,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  bool get isAdmin =&gt; role == UserRole.admin;&#10;&#10;  User copyWith({String? name, String? email}) {&#10;    return User(&#10;      id: id,&#10;      name: name ?? this.name,&#10;      email: email ?? this.email,&#10;      role: role,&#10;      createdAt: createdAt,&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum UserRole { user, moderator, admin }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// domain/entities/user.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String email;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final UserRole role;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final DateTime createdAt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const User({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required this.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required this.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required this.email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required this.role,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required this.createdAt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool get isAdmin => role == UserRole.admin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  User copyWith({String? name, String? email}) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      id: id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      name: name ?? this.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      email: email ?? this.email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      role: role,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      createdAt: createdAt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum UserRole { user, moderator, admin }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"repository-接口与实现\">Repository 接口与实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// domain/repositories/user_repository.dart（接口，在 Domain 层）&#10;abstract interface class UserRepository {&#10;  Future&lt;User&gt; getCurrentUser();&#10;  Future&lt;User&gt; updateProfile({required String name, String? avatarUrl});&#10;  Stream&lt;User&gt; watchCurrentUser();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// domain/repositories/user_repository.dart（接口，在 Domain 层）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract interface class UserRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;User> getCurrentUser();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;User> updateProfile({required String name, String? avatarUrl});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Stream&#x3C;User> watchCurrentUser();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// data/repositories/user_repository_impl.dart（实现，在 Data 层）&#10;@LazySingleton(as: UserRepository)  // injectable 注解&#10;class UserRepositoryImpl implements UserRepository {&#10;  final UserRemoteDataSource _remote;&#10;  final UserLocalDataSource _local;&#10;&#10;  const UserRepositoryImpl({&#10;    required UserRemoteDataSource remote,&#10;    required UserLocalDataSource local,&#10;  }) : _remote = remote, _local = local;&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Future&lt;User&gt; getCurrentUser() async {&#10;    try {&#10;      final dto = await _remote.getCurrentUser();&#10;      await _local.cacheUser(dto);&#10;      return dto.toEntity();&#10;    } on NetworkException {&#10;      // 网络失败时回退到缓存&#10;      final cached = await _local.getCachedUser();&#10;      if (cached == null) rethrow;&#10;      return cached.toEntity();&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Stream&lt;User&gt; watchCurrentUser() {&#10;    return _local.watchUser().map((dto) =&gt; dto.toEntity());&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// data/repositories/user_repository_impl.dart（实现，在 Data 层）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@LazySingleton(as: UserRepository)  // injectable 注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserRepositoryImpl implements UserRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final UserRemoteDataSource _remote;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final UserLocalDataSource _local;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const UserRepositoryImpl({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required UserRemoteDataSource remote,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    required UserLocalDataSource local,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }) : _remote = remote, _local = local;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;User> getCurrentUser() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final dto = await _remote.getCurrentUser();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await _local.cacheUser(dto);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return dto.toEntity();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } on NetworkException {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 网络失败时回退到缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final cached = await _local.getCachedUser();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (cached == null) rethrow;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return cached.toEntity();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Stream&#x3C;User> watchCurrentUser() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return _local.watchUser().map((dto) => dto.toEntity());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"use-case-封装业务逻辑\">Use Case：封装业务逻辑</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// domain/usecases/get_current_user.dart&#10;@lazySingleton&#10;class GetCurrentUser {&#10;  final UserRepository _repository;&#10;  const GetCurrentUser(this._repository);&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;User&gt; call() =&gt; _repository.getCurrentUser();&#10;}&#10;&#10;// domain/usecases/update_user_profile.dart&#10;class UpdateProfileParams {&#10;  final String name;&#10;  final String? avatarUrl;&#10;  const UpdateProfileParams({required this.name, this.avatarUrl});&#10;}&#10;&#10;@lazySingleton&#10;class UpdateUserProfile {&#10;  final UserRepository _repository;&#10;  const UpdateUserProfile(this._repository);&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;User&gt; call(UpdateProfileParams params) {&#10;    return _repository.updateProfile(&#10;      name: params.name,&#10;      avatarUrl: params.avatarUrl,&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// domain/usecases/get_current_user.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@lazySingleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class GetCurrentUser {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final UserRepository _repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const GetCurrentUser(this._repository);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;User> call() => _repository.getCurrentUser();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// domain/usecases/update_user_profile.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UpdateProfileParams {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String? avatarUrl;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const UpdateProfileParams({required this.name, this.avatarUrl});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@lazySingleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UpdateUserProfile {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final UserRepository _repository;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const UpdateUserProfile(this._repository);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;User> call(UpdateProfileParams params) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return _repository.updateProfile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      name: params.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      avatarUrl: params.avatarUrl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖注入-get_it-injectable\">依赖注入：get_it + injectable</h2><p><code>get_it</code> 是服务定位器（Service Locator）模式的实现，<code>injectable</code> 通过代码生成自动注册所有带注解的类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// core/di/injection.dart&#10;@InjectableInit()&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; configureDependencies() =&gt; getIt.init();&#10;&#10;// 在 main.dart 中初始化&#10;void main() async {&#10;  WidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();&#10;  await configureDependencies();  // 注册所有依赖&#10;  runApp(ProviderScope(child: MyApp()));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// core/di/injection.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InjectableInit()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> configureDependencies() => getIt.init();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 main.dart 中初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  WidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await configureDependencies();  // 注册所有依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  runApp(ProviderScope(child: MyApp()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 运行代码生成&#10;# dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 运行代码生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注解速查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注解</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@lazySingleton</code></td>\n<td>懒加载单例，首次使用时创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@singleton</code></td>\n<td>饿汉式单例，<code>init()</code> 时立即创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@injectable</code></td>\n<td>每次请求创建新实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@LazySingleton(as: Interface)</code></td>\n<td>将实现类注册为接口的单例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@module</code></td>\n<td>配置模块，用于注册第三方类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dto-数据传输对象\">DTO：数据传输对象</h2><p>DTO（Data Transfer Object）负责 JSON 反序列化和与 Entity 的转换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// data/models/user_dto.dart&#10;@JsonSerializable()&#10;class UserDto {&#10;  final String id;&#10;  final String name;&#10;  final String email;&#10;  @JsonKey(name: &#39;user_role&#39;)&#10;  final String role;&#10;  @JsonKey(name: &#39;created_at&#39;)&#10;  final String createdAt;&#10;&#10;  const UserDto({...});&#10;&#10;  factory UserDto.fromJson(Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt; json) =&gt;&#10;      _$UserDtoFromJson(json);&#10;&#10;  Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt; toJson() =&gt; _$UserDtoToJson(this);&#10;&#10;  // 转换为领域 Entity&#10;  User toEntity() =&gt; User(&#10;    id: id,&#10;    name: name,&#10;    email: email,&#10;    role: UserRole.values.byName(role),&#10;    createdAt: DateTime.parse(createdAt),&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// data/models/user_dto.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@JsonSerializable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserDto {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String email;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @JsonKey(name: 'user_role')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String role;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @JsonKey(name: 'created_at')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String createdAt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const UserDto({...});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  factory UserDto.fromJson(Map&#x3C;String, dynamic> json) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _$UserDtoFromJson(json);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Map&#x3C;String, dynamic> toJson() => _$UserDtoToJson(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 转换为领域 Entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  User toEntity() => User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id: id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email: email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    role: UserRole.values.byName(role),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    createdAt: DateTime.parse(createdAt),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Clean Architecture 在 Flutter 中的落地价值在于<strong>可测试性</strong>和<strong>可替换性</strong>：领域层（Entity + Use Case + Repository 接口）完全独立于框架，可以用纯 Dart 单元测试覆盖；数据层（Repository 实现 + Data Source）可以在不改动领域层的前提下替换 API、数据库或缓存策略。核心操作规则：<strong>依赖方向永远向内</strong>，Domain 层不导入任何框架代码，DTO 在数据层边界转换为 Entity。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"state-management-patterns\">状态管理模式对比</a> — Riverpod Notifier 作为 ViewModel 层的实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"navigation-routing\">导航与路由 2.0</a> — 展示层的路由与页面组织</li>\n<li><a href=\"../production/testing-strategies\">测试策略</a> — 如何对各层编写隔离测试</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Clean Architecture 在 Flutter 中的实践","id":"clean-architecture-在-flutter-中的实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三层架构全景","id":"三层架构全景"},{"level":2,"text":"目录结构设计","id":"目录结构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"Entity：领域模型","id":"entity-领域模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Repository 接口与实现","id":"repository-接口与实现"},{"level":2,"text":"Use Case：封装业务逻辑","id":"use-case-封装业务逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖注入：get_it + injectable","id":"依赖注入-get_it-injectable"},{"level":2,"text":"DTO：数据传输对象","id":"dto-数据传输对象"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"状态管理模式对比：Riverpod、Bloc、Provider 与 Signals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/state-management-patterns"},"next":{"title":"导航与路由 2.0：GoRouter、声明式路由与深度链接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/navigation-routing"}}